{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Taoyuan Village to heal your loneliness. Here, you can lead a carefree, self-sufficient life: farm, tame animals, raise livestock, fish, and build a prosperous homestead. Or, immerse in village life, meet kindred spirits, find love, and influence their destinies with your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u7f8e\u5973\u5934\u56fe4.0.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/An_Ideal_Land.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's the labor you put in or the relationships you cultivate, every drop of sweat you shed will bear fruit. In Taoyuan Village, no effort goes unrewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u8015\u79cd.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Prosperity_Through_Hard_Work.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are nine major occupations: farming, forestry, animal husbandry, fishing, tailoring, cooking, construction, mining, or martial arts. Which one do you want to excel in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u70f9\u996a.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Construct_Buildings.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your house, furnish it with decorations, and create your ideal countryside compound.\u00a0&quot;Where the heart finds peace is home.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u88c5\u4fee2.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Tame_the_Wild.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend wild creatures\u2014train them as assistants or keep them as companions.\u00a0The world may be frayed, but little paws mend it stitch by stitch.\u00a0(And yes, those with hooves or wings count too!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u9a6f\u517d.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Bond_with_the_Locals.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The villagers may be few, but each has a past, a story, and their own flaws and virtues\u2014just like real people. Treat them with sincerity, and their attitudes toward you will change. You might even alter the course of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u793e\u4ea4.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Celebrate_Traditions.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience vibrant festivals\u2014Spring Festival, Qingming, Dragon Boat, Qixi, Mid-Autumn, Chongyang\u2014along with grand Chinese-style weddings and bustling rural fairs. Immerse yourself in the most traditional Chinese flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/616\u5143\u5bb5GIF.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2678830?t=1749467223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749467223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/5d7b67cf2e1d9240832ae83429915e045fa5bd9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749467223","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/5d7b67cf2e1d9240832ae83429915e045fa5bd9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749467223","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3573730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Taoyuan Village to heal your loneliness. Here, you can lead a carefree, self-sufficient life: farm, tame animals, raise livestock, fish, and build a prosperous homestead. Or, immerse in village life, meet kindred spirits, find love, and influence their destinies with your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u7f8e\u5973\u5934\u56fe4.0.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/An_Ideal_Land.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's the labor you put in or the relationships you cultivate, every drop of sweat you shed will bear fruit. In Taoyuan Village, no effort goes unrewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u8015\u79cd.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Prosperity_Through_Hard_Work.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are nine major occupations: farming, forestry, animal husbandry, fishing, tailoring, cooking, construction, mining, or martial arts. Which one do you want to excel in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u70f9\u996a.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Construct_Buildings.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your house, furnish it with decorations, and create your ideal countryside compound.\u00a0&quot;Where the heart finds peace is home.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u88c5\u4fee2.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Tame_the_Wild.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend wild creatures\u2014train them as assistants or keep them as companions.\u00a0The world may be frayed, but little paws mend it stitch by stitch.\u00a0(And yes, those with hooves or wings count too!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u9a6f\u517d.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Bond_with_the_Locals.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The villagers may be few, but each has a past, a story, and their own flaws and virtues\u2014just like real people. Treat them with sincerity, and their attitudes toward you will change. You might even alter the course of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/\u793e\u4ea4.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/Celebrate_Traditions.png?t=1749467223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience vibrant festivals\u2014Spring Festival, Qingming, Dragon Boat, Qixi, Mid-Autumn, Chongyang\u2014along with grand Chinese-style weddings and bustling rural fairs. Immerse yourself in the most traditional Chinese flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/616\u5143\u5bb5GIF.gif?t=1749467223\" /></div></p>","developers":["BotanX"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/83e0a2e6fd0661dfd7306b2816e254291e2b952c/header.jpg?t=1749467223","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requi